ons.\r\n\r\nIn terms of the News tab, here is my feedback:\r\n- maybe use a max width for the text. I have seen some UX website recommend lines to be between 50 and 75 characters long (80 max according to W3C: https://www.w3.org/WAI/tutorials/page-structure/styling/);\r\n\r\nif possible /  maybe later:\r\n- show the nice picture/thumbnail of the post\r\n- show the author before the date, as on the website\r\n- show the category (as a pill maybe?)\r\n- add a filter by category?\r\n- in terms of performance, would it make sense to paginate?\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5437209381/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]